control: A rotated refresh token is handed to the account snapshot library after every page, a page that failed included, and a failed write-back ends the pass in an error
removes: no refresh token is handed over, so a rotation never reaches the database
packages: ./backfill
tests: TestTheSourcesRefreshTokenIsHandedOver TestAFailedWriteBackEndsTheRunInError TestARunHandsEachAccountOverWhenItsUnitEnds
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

